    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that's isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.apng?t=1752245805\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop\u2014a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.webm?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.mp4?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won\u2019t explore itself\u2014so what are you waiting for?</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.apng?t=1752245805\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/960a2d906241cfe74076ac7ca5a96bba.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Harness your inner gunslinger with gun-jumping, pistol-whipping action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/8bc7b2e4b116235762dd0ca3805253c2.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Collect and redeem tickets for fun prizes from vending machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/3deabea7a018325c1b4ba4f17a9d651e.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Unlock and wield unique items and strange abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/6ac436185874158274c27a781fb5c14c.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Wear a variety of silly, stylish, and occasionally useful hats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/aee6441e21e22313ef07ce607d124b32.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Enjoy a colorful pixel art style bursting with personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/62ff290a56db130be8d3b63ed8652dfb.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div> Mark up your map as you explore the world of Dewdrop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/5ba5862d309a11630eab679c3fc4b35c.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Face off against bosses and wacky enemies using items collected along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/a11da29f135b5c73696c07baca985c72.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Explore a lighthearted world full of charm, humor, and quirky characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/9e9bb4dbdb7f848d889d88cb017adb73.webp?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Plus, an original soundtrack composed by the talented <strong>Peter Reid Jones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.webm?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.mp4?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/8d73260d070ab7c08a2013939f867515.avif?t=1752245805\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that's isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.apng?t=1752245805\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop\u2014a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.poster.avif?t=1752245805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.webm?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/2b975140e0d900506878804df0e17282.mp4?t=1752245805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won\u2019t explore itself\u2014so what are you waiting for?</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets